USE /v0.1.4/demos/zero-ad/Dollyfile-pkgconf f2eefebe70ee928b4d58cc43c19d640afd00da21a0f69da98330ad86193274e1
REQUIRES TOOL meson
REQUIRES TOOL xz
REQUIRES TOOL tar

